      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "12",
          "section": "4.1.2",
          "quote": "cracks occur when the liquid film adhering to the solid surface in the late stage of joint solidification (about 1265 ℃) is torn by stress and cannot be sufficiently or promptly backfilled",
