      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "8",
          "section": "3.3",
          "quote": "stress concentration occurs at MC carbides and pre-existing solidification cracks. This leads to crack initiation, followed by propagation, ultimately resulting in macroscopic fracture of the joint.",
